Subject: [PATCH 1861/3799] soh: rename func_80AEFF94 -> EnRu1_SetupSwitchRuto

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: puts Ruto into the standing-on-the-switch state when the story flags say she has been met and is not currently kidnapped, printing the "Ruto switch set" trace either way.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ru1/z_en_ru1.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ru1/z_en_ru1.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ru1/z_en_ru1.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ru1/z_en_ru1.c
index 048f6f0b8..1b587d240 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ru1/z_en_ru1.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ru1/z_en_ru1.c
@@ -2378,7 +2378,8 @@ void EnRu1_ThroneRoom_Talk(EnRu1* this, PlayState* play) {
     EnRu1_EndThroneRoomTalk(this, play);
 }
 
-void func_80AEFF94(EnRu1* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80AEFF94: puts Ruto into the standing-on-the-switch state when the story flags say she has been met and is not currently kidnapped, printing the "Ruto switch set" trace either way.
+void EnRu1_SetupSwitchRuto(EnRu1* this, PlayState* play) {
     s8 actorRoom;
 
     if (Flags_GetInfTable(INFTABLE_RUTO_IN_JJ_MEET_RUTO) && Flags_GetInfTable(INFTABLE_140) &&
@@ -2448,7 +2449,7 @@ void EnRu1_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
             EnRu1_InitBesideKingZora(this, play);
             break;
         case 6:
-            func_80AEFF94(this, play);
+            EnRu1_SetupSwitchRuto(this, play);  // was func_80AEFF94 [LLM:HIGH]
             break;
         case 10:
             func_80AF0050(this, play);
